# Default: Gemini on Vertex AI, authenticated by `gcloud auth application-default login` locally
# and by the service account on Cloud Run. Nothing to set here.
#
# To try it without gcloud, get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and use:
# MODEL=gemini/gemini-3.5-flash
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-key
